WEBVTT

01:02:43.626 --> 01:02:46.420
Houston to Mission Control.
Come in, Control.

01:02:46.712 --> 01:02:49.881
Launch pad is being constructed.

01:02:51.592 --> 01:02:52.801
All right, listen up.

01:02:52.885 --> 01:02:55.679
I need Pump Boy here,
Ducky here.

01:02:55.763 --> 01:02:58.473
Legs, you're with Ducky.

01:02:59.225 --> 01:03:01.893
RollerBob and I don't move
'til we get the signal. Clear?
